# Pub workspace root — the resolved .dart_tool/ (package_config.json etc.)
# and build output live here, not in the individual member packages, since
# this is a pub *workspace* (client/pubspec.yaml has `workspace: [medium,
# app]`). client/pubspec.lock is intentionally NOT ignored here — for an
# application workspace like this one, the lockfile is committed for
# reproducible builds.
.dart_tool/
build/
